@startuml admin-views-reports
' Sequence: Admin (SuperAdmin role) views the Reports tab
' Source of truth:
'   Frontend : src/views/SuperAdminReports.vue, src/stores/superadmin.js, src/services/api/api.js
'   Backend  : backend/studybuddy/admin_views.py (AdminAnalyticsView,
'              SuperAdminInstitutionPerformanceView)
'   Routes   : backend/studybuddy/urls.py, src/router/index.js

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor Admin
participant "Vue.js Frontend" as FE
participant "Django Backend" as BE
database "PostgreSQL DB" as DB

note over Admin, DB
  Pre-condition: Admin is authenticated with the SuperAdmin role and needs to
  review platform or institution-level performance.
end note

autonumber

Admin -> FE : Opens "Reports" tab
activate FE

FE -> BE : Request institution list and\nper-institution performance breakdown
activate BE
BE -> DB : Fetch institutions, tutors, tutees,\nbookings and payments
activate DB
DB --> BE : Return raw aggregate data
deactivate DB
BE --> FE : Send institution breakdown
deactivate BE

loop On first load, then on every filter change\n(period: 7D / 30D / 3M / All, institution: one or all)

  Admin -> FE : Applies filters\n(skipped on first load — defaults to 30D, all institutions)

  FE -> BE : Request analytics for the selected\nperiod and institution
  activate BE

  BE -> BE : Authorize request:\nvalid access token + SuperAdmin role

  alt Authorized

    BE -> DB : Fetch bookings, payments, tutors\nand subject records for the period
    activate DB
    DB --> BE : Return raw aggregate data
    deactivate DB

    BE -> BE : Format data into report structure
    note right of BE
      Stats presented:
      - Gross revenue, platform commissions (10%)
        and tutor payouts
      - Session completion rate
      - Top-performing tutors ranking
        (sessions, rating, earnings)
      - Subject demand distribution
      - Completed-session time-series
        (zero-padded for gaps)
    end note

    BE --> FE : Send analytics report
    deactivate BE
    FE -> Admin : Displays metric cards, charts\nand tabular report

  else Not authorized / session expired

    BE --> FE : Reject the request
    FE -> Admin : Shows error state or returns\nthe Admin to the login screen

  end

end

deactivate FE

note over Admin, DB
  Post-condition: Admin has an up-to-date report for the chosen period and
  institution.
end note

@enduml
